    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふぅ──席たくさん空いてたな\r\n今回の撮影場所、少し遠いから座れてよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n……ふふ、ちょっとだけ貸し切りみたいです",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040010040",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "0014",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな\r\n……出発、朝早くだったけど、体調とか大丈夫か、真乃？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "お気遣いありがとうございます\r\nでも、全然平気ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……それじゃあ、今のうちに\r\n今日のスケジュールを確認しておくか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nよろしくお願いしますっ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まず、電車を降りて少し歩くみたいだから……\r\n撮影場所に到着するのはお昼前くらいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "駅からは、直接山に向かうんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ちょっとした傾斜はあるだろうけど\r\n綺麗な紅葉を見ながら登れるかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n今から楽しみですっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは。真乃、本当に楽しみみたいだな\r\n表情にすごく出てるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……っ\r\nわ、私、そんな顔に出てましたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n向かってる場所のことは知ってるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと……撮影場所のことを聞いてから\r\nずっと調べたりしていました……っ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか。ロケ地に選ばれるくらいだから\r\nこの時期は特にいいって評判らしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n写真もいくつか見たんですけれど、どれも綺麗で……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "この山に登れるんだなって思ったら\r\n早く行きたいなぁって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私が見た景色を、灯織ちゃんとめぐるちゃんにも\r\n見てもらいたくて、写真もたくさん撮りた──",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040110"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──ふぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃？\r\n眠たいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "す、すみません……そうみたいです……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……朝も早かったからな\r\n着くまで休んでくれてても大丈夫だぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あ、あの……\r\n……ありがとうございます……っ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……えっと、じゃあ\r\n少しだけ甘えさせてもらってもいいでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n着いたら起こすから、ゆっくり休んでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009040160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい……\r\nおやすみなさい、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100904/2001009040160"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
